251
00:13:15,751 --> 00:13:18,362
WELL, I MUST SAY,
I'M GLAD TO HEAR THAT.

252
00:13:18,362 --> 00:13:20,625
I DIDN'T LIKE
THE SOUND OF HIM.

253
00:13:20,625 --> 00:13:23,324
[coughs]

254
00:13:23,324 --> 00:13:26,414
[choking]

255
00:13:26,414 --> 00:13:28,808
I LOVE YOU SO MUCH.

256
00:13:28,808 --> 00:13:32,637
[whispers] YOU'RE THE BEST THING
I EVER DID.

257
00:13:32,637 --> 00:13:36,685
AND I AM SO... PROUD OF YOU.

258
00:13:36,685 --> 00:13:39,253
[crying] Mom.

259
00:13:39,253 --> 00:13:40,776
SHH, SHH, SHH!

260
00:13:40,776 --> 00:13:43,344
WHEN I'M GONE,

261
00:13:43,344 --> 00:13:46,347
YOU MUSTN'T WASTE TIME
BEING SAD.

262
00:13:46,347 --> 00:13:50,699
A LITTLE WHILE IS OKAY,
BUT NOT TOO LONG.

263
00:13:50,699 --> 00:13:54,398
YOU BE BRAVE.

264
00:13:54,398 --> 00:13:56,487
AND BE HAPPY.

265
00:13:56,487 --> 00:13:59,099
[crying]

266
00:13:59,099 --> 00:14:01,623
BYE, BABY.

267
00:14:01,623 --> 00:14:04,234
[sobbing] Mom!

268
00:14:04,234 --> 00:14:06,280
Mom!BYE, BABY.

269
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,803
