[chokes]

276
00:14:27,301 --> 00:14:31,609
[sobbing]

277
00:14:31,609 --> 00:14:33,394
SHE'S GONE, BABY.

278
00:14:33,394 --> 00:14:35,004
SHE'S GONE.

279
00:14:35,004 --> 00:14:37,877
[continues sobbing]

280
00:14:44,796 --> 00:14:48,757
[indistinct conversations]

281
00:14:48,757 --> 00:14:50,063
SHE'S DEAD?

282
00:14:50,063 --> 00:14:51,629
