PROCEDURE.HOW DOES THAT WORK?

287
00:15:09,256 --> 00:15:11,780
IT'S A LOW-INTENSITY
MICRO-RADIATION BATH

288
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:13,782
BUILT IN FOR THIS EVENTUALITY.

289
00:15:13,782 --> 00:15:16,045
THE CHAMBER IS IRRADIATED.
THE VIRUS IS DESTROYED.

290
00:15:16,045 --> 00:15:18,526
ALICIA'S BODY'S NOT HARMED.

291
00:15:18,526 --> 00:15:21,529
HOW LONG UNTIL WE CAN EXAMINE
THE CRIME SCENE?WHOA.

292
00:15:21,529 --> 00:15:23,879
IT'S NOT A CRIME SCENE UNTIL
YOU KNOW THERE'S A CRIME, RIGHT?

293
00:15:23,879 --> 00:15:25,968
WELL, YOU DON'T KNOW
THERE'S BEEN A MURDER HERE.

294
00:15:25,968 --> 00:15:28,579
WHERE'S YOUR EVIDENCE?ALICIA'S SEBERG'S WORD.

295
00:15:28,579 --> 00:15:31,408
WHY WOULD SHE LIE?SHE HAD A BRAIN FREEZE.

296
00:15:31,408 --> 00:15:33,497
SHE SCREWED UP,
AND SHE CAN'T ADMIT THE FACT.

297
00:15:33,497 --> 00:15:36,413
IT HAPPENS. I'VE BEEN WORKING
THIS BEAT FOR A LONG TIME.

298
00:15:36,413 --> 00:15:39,286
I'VE SEEN THE SAME DENIAL,
SAME CERTAINTY.

299
00:15:39,286 --> 00:15:41,462
IT'S HUMAN NATURE.I DISAGREE. I BELIEVE HER.

300
00:15:41,462 --> 00:15:43,290
I'M CALLING THIS IN
AS A HOMICIDE.

301
00:15:43,290 --> 00:15:45,335
AND I'M SORRY IF THIS
COMPLICATES YOUR WORK,

302
00:15:45,335 --> 00:15:48,425
BUT IT'S MY JOB.THAT'S FINE. OKAY.
DOING YOUR JOB.

303
00:15:48,425 --> 00:15:50,471
BUT THIS IS STILL
A LIVE OUTBREAK,

304
