AS PER C.D.C.A. PROTOCOLS.

306
00:15:57,826 --> 00:15:59,306
ABSOLUTELY.

307
00:16:04,441 --> 00:16:06,835
[Van Pelt]
UNTIL THE SUMMER OF '08,

308
00:16:06,835 --> 00:16:09,969
SEBERG, EDMUNDS, NASH AND TRIPP
ALL WORKED TOGETHER

309
00:16:09,969 --> 00:16:12,275
AT THE NORTHERN CALIFORNIA
TECHNOLOGY INSTITUTE

310
00:16:12,275 --> 00:16:14,277
BIOCHEMISTRY DEPARTMENT.[clicking keys]

311
00:16:14,277 --> 00:16:16,323
SEBERG AND EDMUNDS
LEFT ABRUPTLY--

312
00:16:16,323 --> 00:16:18,325
SOME KIND OF LEGAL DISPUTE.

313
00:16:18,325 --> 00:16:20,370
OKAY, CHO AND I
WILL CHECK IT OUT.

314
