352
00:18:12,482 --> 00:18:15,137
AS DID FLORIAN TRIPP
AND LILITH NASH.

353
00:18:15,137 --> 00:18:19,010
IS THAT CORRECT?YES. BRILLIANT RESEARCH TEAM.
