NO, THANK YOU.

383
00:20:01,374 --> 00:20:04,072
ALL RIGHT.

384
00:20:04,072 --> 00:20:06,422
HMM. [chewing] REALLY GOOD.

385
00:20:17,694 --> 00:20:19,783
HI.

386
00:20:19,783 --> 00:20:22,786
CAN YOU HEAR ME?

387
00:20:22,786 --> 00:20:24,310
