AND IT OCCURRED TO ME THAT
CHOCOLATE WOULD BE GOOD FOR YOU.

401
00:21:01,651 --> 00:21:05,873
ALL THAT EMOTION--
IT WIPES YOU OUT.

402
00:21:05,873 --> 00:21:07,875
AND SUGAR'S GOOD
FOR ENERGY.

403
00:21:07,875 --> 00:21:10,921
My mother is dead.

404
00:21:10,921 --> 00:21:13,228
CHOCOLATE AND GRIEF
IS A GOOD COMBINATION.

405
00:21:13,228 --> 00:21:16,927
YOU SHOULD TRY IT.
IT'LL TASTE SO MUCH... DEEPER,

406
00:21:16,927 --> 00:21:19,756
MORE INTENSE.

407
00:21:19,756 --> 00:21:22,672
EVERYTHING WILL FEEL THAT WAY
FOR A WHILE.

408
00:21:22,672 --> 00:21:24,587
YOU'LL FEEL MORE ALIVE.

409
00:21:24,587 --> 00:21:27,547
YOU SHOULD PROBABLY TRY
TO HANG ON TO THAT FEELING

410
00:21:27,547 --> 00:21:30,376
AS LONG AS YOU CAN.
IT'S A GIFT.

411
00:21:30,376 --> 00:21:33,204
I guess.

412
00:21:33,204 --> 00:21:35,903
I WANT YOU TO DO SOMETHING
FOR ME NOW, ISABEL.

413
00:21:35,903 --> 00:21:38,297
I WANT YOU TO PLEASE
TURN OFF YOUR COMPUTER

414
00:21:38,297 --> 00:21:40,777
