415
00:21:42,997 --> 00:21:44,607
YOU DO THAT NOW.

416
00:21:48,394 --> 00:21:49,656
[beep]

417
00:22:07,456 --> 00:22:09,066
OPEN SESAME.

418
00:22:09,066 --> 00:22:12,548
[rapid beeping and whirring]

419
