424
00:22:28,695 --> 00:22:30,000
YES.

425
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:32,742
EXCUSE ME. UH...
SORRY TO INTERRUPT.

426
00:22:32,742 --> 00:22:35,266
WE NEED TO EXPAND
THE POOL OF SUSPECTS.

427
00:22:35,266 --> 00:22:38,966
