442
00:23:13,783 --> 00:23:15,742
IT'S A SUPPLICANT GESTURE,

443
00:23:15,742 --> 00:23:17,483
SUGGESTING
A GUILTY CONSCIENCE.

444
00:23:17,483 --> 00:23:19,223
THAT--THAT'S NOT VALID
OR RELEVANT.

445
00:23:19,223 --> 00:23:21,791
I'M--I'M SIMPLY STATING
THE FACTS. I HAVE NO IDEA

446
00:23:21,791 --> 00:23:23,793
