THAT'S YOUR OPINION,

449
00:23:29,451 --> 00:23:33,324
BUT I-I HAVE NO CONTROL
OVER THAT.MR. PRICE, YOU'RE UNDER ARREST.

450
00:23:33,324 --> 00:23:34,935
FOR WHAT?LET'S SEE.

451
00:23:34,935 --> 00:23:37,416
FOR ONE,
THE MURDER OF ALICIA SEBERG.

452
00:23:37,416 --> 00:23:39,853
THAT'S ABSURD.

453
00:23:39,853 --> 00:23:41,768
AND FRANKLY, NOT YOUR CALL.OH, IS THAT RIGHT?

454
00:23:41,768 --> 00:23:44,031
YEAH, THIS HOMICIDE
INVESTIGATION IS OURS.

455
00:23:44,031 --> 00:23:47,382
IF WE CAN'T GET ALONG,
I'LL CALL MY FRIENDS AT THE FBI,

456
00:23:47,382 --> 00:23:49,210
GET THEM TO TAKE OVER
FROM YOU.

457
00:23:49,210 --> 00:23:51,734
IN FACT, I WILLDO THAT.
I'M SORRY, LITTLE LADY--

458
00:23:51,734 --> 00:23:53,867
MAYBE YOU SHOULD STEP BACK--

459
00:23:53,867 --> 00:23:57,740
MAY-MAYBE I WAS RIGHT ABOUT
THE SUPPLICANT PALM GESTURE.

460
00:23:57,740 --> 00:23:58,698
YEP.

461
00:24:08,272 --> 00:24:09,883
[engine starts]

462
00:24:09,883 --> 00:24:14,235
[tires screech, siren wailing]

463
00:24:17,978 --> 00:24:21,372
[brakes screeching]

464
00:24:30,338 --> 00:24:33,210
[indistinct conversations]

465
00:24:41,828 --> 00:24:44,004
I... I WANNA TALK
TO MY LAWYER.

466
00:24:44,004 --> 00:24:47,311
YOU HAVE THAT RIGHT,
BUT IF IT DOESN'T--

467
00:24:47,311 --> 00:24:50,010
HAVE YOU EVER SAT IN THE BACK
OF A MILITARY AIRCRAFT

468
00:24:50,010 --> 00:24:52,882
WITH A BLACK HOOD
OVER YOUR HEAD?UH... NO.

469
00:24:52,882 --> 00:24:54,884
WELL, THEN YOU GOT
A NEW EXPERIENCE COMIN',

470
00:24:54,884 --> 00:24:58,018
BECAUSE THAT IS WHERE THIS IS
GOIN' UNLESS YOU START TALKIN'

471
00:24:58,018 --> 00:25:00,194
RIGHT ABOUT NOW!UM... LOOK--

472
00:25:00,194 --> 00:25:01,543
QUIET.

473
00:25:01,543 --> 00:25:02,588
PLEASE.

474
00:25:05,373 --> 00:25:07,810
THE CONTRACTOR SCREWED UP.

475
00:25:07,810 --> 00:25:09,464
THE SOFTWARE GLITCHES
CONSTANTLY,

476
00:25:09,464 --> 00:25:12,249
SO... THEY'RE FIXING IT.

477
00:25:12,249 --> 00:25:15,514
MEANWHILE, THE SYSTEM'S DOWN...
TEMPORARILY.

478
00:25:15,514 --> 00:25:18,865
NOBODY KNEW THE SYSTEM WAS DOWN,
SO IN A WAY,

479
00:25:18,865 --> 00:25:21,824
IT WORKED JUST AS IF
IT WAS UP AND RUNNING...

480
00:25:21,824 --> 00:25:24,392
IN A WAY.HOW LONG WAS IT DOWN FOR?

481
00:25:24,392 --> 00:25:26,612
TWO... MONTHS.

482
00:25:26,612 --> 00:25:30,006
TWO MONTHS?ANYONE AT ALL
COULD ENTER THE LAB--

483
00:25:30,006 --> 00:25:31,834
TERRORISTS, CRAZIES,
THIEVES.

484
00:25:31,834 --> 00:25:34,358
HAVE YOU ANY IDEA
HOW MUCH TROUBLE YOU'RE IN?

485
00:25:34,358 --> 00:25:36,273
THIEVES?

486
00:25:36,273 --> 00:25:38,014
PEOPLE WANNA STEAL GERMS?

487
00:25:38,014 --> 00:25:42,802
CRYPTOHANSA B STRAIN IS A--
IS A MUST-HAVE RESEARCH TOOL.

488
00:25:42,802 --> 00:25:44,455
IT'S HARD TO MAKE.

489
00:25:44,455 --> 00:25:47,937
IT'S WORTH $300,000 A GRAM
IN THE BLACK MARKET.

490
00:25:47,937 --> 00:25:50,853
WOW.ISN'T THAT RIGHT, PRICE?

491
00:25:50,853 --> 00:25:53,943
AND YOU LEFT THE CUPBOARD DOOR
WIDE OPEN.

492
00:25:53,943 --> 00:25:57,294
[chuckles] YOU ARE YEA DEEP
IN TROUBLE, PAL.

493
00:25:57,294 --> 00:26:00,515
YOU THINK ABOUT YOUR SITUATION
FOR A WHILE.

494
00:26:00,515 --> 00:26:03,736
OKAY?
AND WE'LL TALK AGAIN.

495
00:26:19,273 --> 00:26:21,580
YOU KNOW HE DIDN'T
KILL ALICIA SEBERG.

496
00:26:21,580 --> 00:26:24,583
YOU JUST LIKE
SCARING PEOPLE, RIGHT?HEY,
IF THERE WAS A MURDER HERE,

497
00:26:24,583 --> 00:26:28,499
I THINK
HE'S A VERY GOOD SUSPECT.WHY? HE HAS NO INTEREST
IN HER DEATH.

498
00:26:28,499 --> 00:26:32,025
IT COULD ONLY LEAD TO DISCOVERY
OF THE SECURITY BREAKDOWN.WE'LL SEE IF HE HAD
ANY OTHER MOTIVES.

499
00:26:32,025 --> 00:26:34,636
THE SALIENT POINT HERE IS
THAT ANYONE COULD HAVE GOTTEN

500
00:26:34,636 --> 00:26:37,596
TO THOSE FLASKS,
NOT JUST PRICE.

501
00:26:37,596 --> 00:26:40,511
KASEEM COULD HAVE, FOR INSTANCE,
OR YOU COULD HAVE.

502
00:26:40,511 --> 00:26:43,210
YOU WERE ALREADY HERE,
WEREN'T YOU?

503
00:26:43,210 --> 00:26:45,255
FOR AN INVENTORY CHECK?

504
00:26:45,255 --> 00:26:47,997
WHAT TIME DID YOU GET HERE,
EXACTLY?

505
00:26:47,997 --> 00:26:50,130
THE NIGHT BEFORE, RIGHT?YOU REMIND ME.

506
00:26:50,130 --> 00:26:52,785
I WAS GONNA CALL THE FBI,
REPLACE YOU PEOPLE.

507
00:26:52,785 --> 00:26:54,917
AND I WAS GONNA TELL YOU
THAT'S NOT YOUR CALL.

508
00:26:54,917 --> 00:26:57,485
WE'RE HERE ON
THE DIRECT SAY-SO OF THE A.G.

509
00:26:57,485 --> 00:27:01,837
CALL HIM. TELL HIM WE'RE OFF
THE CASE. SEE WHAT HE SAYS.I MIGHT DO THAT.

510
00:27:01,837 --> 00:27:04,405
WE'LL SEE HOW IT GOES,
SHALL WE?

511
00:27:04,405 --> 00:27:07,147
IT'S TIME TO OPEN
THE BIOHAZARD CHAMBER.

512
00:27:07,147 --> 00:27:10,846
OH, THAT SOUNDS FUN,
OPENING THE BIOHAZARD CHAMBER.

513
00:27:14,154 --> 00:27:16,809
SHOULDN'T WE BE
WEARING MASKS OR SOMETHING?

514
00:27:16,809 --> 00:27:19,594
NO VIRUS COULD POSSIBLY
SURVIVE THE RADIATION BATH.

515
00:27:19,594 --> 00:27:23,859
THE VIRUS INSIDE THE FLASKS
ARE STILL ALIVE, OF COURSE.

516
00:27:23,859 --> 00:27:25,861
BUT THE FLASKS
ARE UNBREAKABLE.

517
00:27:25,861 --> 00:27:27,950
THERE'S NO DANGER.

518
00:27:27,950 --> 00:27:30,692
[clicks]

519
00:27:36,785 --> 00:27:38,526
FIVE FLASKS INTACT.

520
00:27:40,093 --> 00:27:42,399
[latches click]

521
00:27:42,399 --> 00:27:45,141
LET'S GET THESE BABIES BACK
IN DEEP FREEZE.

522
00:27:53,062 --> 00:27:55,108
OKAY. WE'RE COPACETIC.

523
00:27:55,108 --> 00:27:57,850
[Lisbon] LET'S SEND
ALICIA SEBERG ON HER WAY.[air whooshes]

524
00:28:03,029 --> 00:28:05,553
DOCTOR, THIS IS
A CRIME SCENE NOW. YOU CAN'T--

525
00:28:05,553 --> 00:28:07,424
[Lisbon] LET HIM STAY.

526
00:28:28,968 --> 00:28:33,363
[woman] OH, MY GOD.

527
00:28:33,363 --> 00:28:35,061
OH, MY GOD.

528
00:28:35,061 --> 00:28:37,063
AND, GRETA, YOU HAD
A SEXUAL RELATIONSHIP

529
00:28:37,063 --> 00:28:38,891
WITH CLIFF EDMUNDS,
THE VICTIM'S HUSBAND,

530
00:28:38,891 --> 00:28:40,414
IS THAT RIGHT?

531
00:28:40,414 --> 00:28:44,505
NO. I MEAN, YES.
IT WASN'T--WELL, YES, I DID.

532
00:28:44,505 --> 00:28:46,507
BUT I DIDN'T.

533
00:28:46,507 --> 00:28:49,510
YOU DON'T THINK I HAD SOMETHING
TO DO WITH KILLING HER?

534
00:28:49,510 --> 00:28:51,555
NO, MA'AM, WE'RE JUST LOOKING

535
00:28:51,555 --> 00:28:55,690
FOR INSIGHT
INTO THEIR RELATIONSHIP.YOU THINK CLIFF KILLED HER.

536
00:28:55,690 --> 00:28:57,910
IS HE THE JEALOUS TYPE?NOT AT ALL.

537
00:28:57,910 --> 00:29:00,042
DID HE EVER SHOW VIOLENCE
TO YOU?

538
00:29:00,042 --> 00:29:02,871
NO, NO. CLIFF IS
A VERY GENTLE SOUL, REALLY.

539
00:29:02,871 --> 00:29:04,873
AND ALICIA'S SUCH
A COOL PERSON.

540
00:29:04,873 --> 00:29:07,702
WE HEARD
THERE WAS TROUBLE.

541
00:29:07,702 --> 00:29:09,051
NO.

542
00:29:09,051 --> 00:29:10,792
WELL... [sighs]

543
00:29:10,792 --> 00:29:12,446
THERE WAS ONE INCIDENT,

544
00:29:12,446 --> 00:29:15,536
BUT IT HAD NOTHING TO DO
WITH CLIFF OR ALICIA, REALLY.

545
00:29:15,536 --> 00:29:17,016
PLEASE CONTINUE.

546
00:29:17,016 --> 00:29:19,627
WE'D BEEN SEEING EACH OTHER
FOR A WHILE.

547
00:29:19,627 --> 00:29:21,629
SOMEBODY LEFT A NOTE
FOR ME,

548
00:29:21,629 --> 00:29:24,588
PUSHED UNDER BY DOOR
IN THE MIDDLE OF THE NIGHT.

549
00:29:24,588 --> 00:29:26,547
BASICALLY,
IT SAID I WAS A WHORE

550
00:29:26,547 --> 00:29:28,462
AND I SHOULD STAY AWAY
FROM CLIFF.

551
00:29:28,462 --> 00:29:31,639
IT WAS VERY UGLY.
IT WAS ANONYMOUS, OF COURSE.

552
00:29:31,639 --> 00:29:35,991
WHO DO YOU THINK
SENT THE NOTE?I THOUGHT AT FIRST IT WAS
ALICIA SEBERG, NATURALLY.

553
00:29:35,991 --> 00:29:38,907
BUT IT TURNS OUT SHE WASN'T
EVEN IN THE COUNTRY

554
00:29:38,907 --> 00:29:41,997
ON THE NIGHT IN QUESTION.WHO'S YOUR NEXT BEST GUESS?

555
00:29:41,997 --> 00:29:44,608
UM, THE ONE TIME I WENT
TO SEE CLIFF AT WORK,

556
00:29:44,608 --> 00:29:46,697
THERE WAS A LAB ASSISTANT.

557
00:29:46,697 --> 00:29:50,832
SHE GAVE ME THIS GLARE
LIKE A DEATH RAY,

558
00:29:50,832 --> 00:29:54,140
AND I THOUGHT MAYBE IT WAS HER.WHAT'S HER NAME?

559
00:29:54,140 --> 00:29:55,794
LILITH NASH.

560
00:29:55,794 --> 00:29:57,839
THE QUESTION IS WHY NOW?

561
00:29:57,839 --> 00:30:00,624
WHAT WAS IT THAT TRIGGERED
THE KILLING? WHAT CHANGED?

562
00:30:00,624 --> 00:30:03,018
WHAT'S THE ANSWER?

563
00:30:03,018 --> 00:30:06,543
[lowers voice] WELL, FOR
ONE THING, HARKEN SHOWED UP.YOU THINK HARKEN DID THIS?

564
00:30:06,543 --> 00:30:08,850
OOH, I'D LIKE THAT.
BUT WHAT'S HIS MOTIVE?

565
00:30:08,850 --> 00:30:10,765
[cell phone rings]

566
00:30:10,765 --> 00:30:12,158
VAN PELT.

567
00:30:12,158 --> 00:30:14,725
Boss, Cho and Rigsby found
an ex-lover

568
00:30:14,725 --> 00:30:16,205
of the vic's husband.

569
00:30:16,205 --> 00:30:18,947
SHE THINKS LILITH NASH SENT HER
A MENACING NOTE.

570
00:30:18,947 --> 00:30:22,081
INTERESTING.So I dug deeper.

571
00:30:22,081 --> 00:30:24,387
NASH IS CLEAN
UNDER HER CURRENT NAME

572
00:30:24,387 --> 00:30:27,695
BUT HAD A BRIEF MARRIAGE
IN CANADA IN '96, '97.

573
00:30:27,695 --> 00:30:30,916
Under that name, Lilith Blaum,
in '99, still in Canada,

574
00:30:30,916 --> 00:30:32,439
she had a restraining order
taken out against her

575
00:30:32,439 --> 00:30:34,963
BY HER EX-HUSBAND
AND SUBSEQUENTLY

576
00:30:34,963 --> 00:30:38,401
SPENT FOUR MONTHS
IN A SECURE MENTAL INSTITUTE.WELL, THAT COULD HAPPEN
TO ANYONE.

577
00:30:38,401 --> 00:30:40,229
UH, VAN PELT,
COULD YOU DO ME A FAVOR?

578
00:30:40,229 --> 00:30:42,318
COULD YOU CALL CHO AND RIGSBY
AND HAVE THEM GET OUT HERE

579
00:30:42,318 --> 00:30:44,016
AS QUICK AS POSSIBLE?WHY?

580
00:30:44,016 --> 00:30:46,409
I GOT A HUNCH
WE'RE GONNA NEED 'EM.OKAY.

581
00:30:46,409 --> 00:30:48,585
Thank you.WILL DO.

582
00:30:48,585 --> 00:30:50,674
LET'S GO TALK TO NASH.MEH.

583
00:30:50,674 --> 00:30:53,112
WHAT?
I THINK SHE'S GOOD FOR IT.AH, SHE'S NUTS.

584
00:30:53,112 --> 00:30:55,723
SHE'S GOT A NUTTY LITTLE
SECRET CRUSH ON THE BOSS,

585
00:30:55,723 --> 00:30:57,681
KILLS THE WIFE.SOMETHING LIKE THAT.

586
00:30:57,681 --> 00:31:00,119
SHE DID SEEM NERVOUS,
BUT WHY KILL NOW?

587
00:31:00,119 --> 00:31:03,296
AND WHY WOULD SHE USE
THE VIRUS?I DON'T KNOW.
LET'S GO AND ASK HER.

588
00:31:03,296 --> 00:31:05,080
UGH, IF YOU WANT TO.

589
00:31:05,080 --> 00:31:07,082
YOU KNOW,
YOU'RE JUST RESISTING NASH

590
00:31:07,082 --> 00:31:09,693
BECAUSE YOU DIDN'T PEG HER
RIGHT AWAY AS THE ONE.

591
00:31:09,693 --> 00:31:12,479
NO, I'M RESISTING NASH BECAUSE,
UH, SHE ISN'T THE ONE.

592
00:31:12,479 --> 00:31:14,829
BUT IF YOU WANNA GO TALK TO HER,
LET'S GO TALK TO HER.

593
00:31:14,829 --> 00:31:18,093
BUT WHATEVER YOU DO,
DO NOT TELL HARKEN.

594
00:31:18,093 --> 00:31:20,052
WHY NOT? IT'S PROCEDURE.

595
00:31:20,052 --> 00:31:22,445
FIG FOR PROCEDURE.
HE'LL STOMP ALL OVER HER.

596
00:31:22,445 --> 00:31:26,188
SHE'LL CLAM UP. YOU'LL GET
NOTHING BUT A WASTE OF TIME.I'M TELLING HARKEN.

597
00:31:26,188 --> 00:31:29,713
[sighs deeply]

598
00:31:29,713 --> 00:31:30,976
OKAY.

599
00:31:42,857 --> 00:31:44,685
[sighs]

600
00:31:46,469 --> 00:31:48,384
NASH, COME WITH ME.

601
00:31:49,864 --> 00:31:51,126
NOW.

602
00:31:58,742 --> 00:32:01,049
THANK YOU.

603
00:32:04,226 --> 00:32:05,836
STAND THERE.

604
00:32:05,836 --> 00:32:07,795
[door closes]

605
00:32:07,795 --> 00:32:09,057
[clank]

606
00:32:10,885 --> 00:32:14,541
LISTEN CLOSELY
AND PLEASE TELL THE TRUTH.

607
00:32:14,541 --> 00:32:17,848
IS THERE A WAY OUT OF HERE
THAT AVOIDS THE MAIN GATES?

608
00:32:17,848 --> 00:32:19,938
A BACK WAY OUT?YES.

609
00:32:19,938 --> 00:32:20,764
WHERE?

610
00:32:20,764 --> 00:32:22,244
WALK A MILE NORTH.

611
00:32:22,244 --> 00:32:24,855
THERE'S A CULVERT
THAT GOES UNDER THE FENCE

612
00:32:24,855 --> 00:32:27,075
HALFWAY ALONG
THE NORTHEAST PROPERTY LINE.

613
00:32:27,075 --> 00:32:30,296
EXCELLENT.
NOW... TELL THE TRUTH.

614
00:32:30,296 --> 00:32:33,603
DID YOU EVER GO
BY THE NAME LILITH BLAUM?

615
00:32:33,603 --> 00:32:35,040
YES.

616
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:37,042
DID YOU SPEND TIME
IN A MENTAL ASYLUM?

617
00:32:37,042 --> 00:32:38,869
YES.

618
00:32:38,869 --> 00:32:42,308
DO YOU HAVE A SECRET CRUSH
ON CLIFF EDMUNDS?

619
00:32:42,308 --> 00:32:43,918
YES.

620
00:32:43,918 --> 00:32:46,268
DID YOU KILL ALICIA SEBERG?

621
00:32:46,268 --> 00:32:48,401
NO.

622
00:32:48,401 --> 00:32:50,011
I BELIEVE YOU,

623
00:32:50,011 --> 00:32:51,970
BUT I KNOW HOW
HARKEN'S THOUGHTS RUN.

624
00:32:51,970 --> 00:32:54,973
A WAY TO BLAME YOU
WILL BE FOUND.

625
00:32:54,973 --> 00:32:57,627
I REPEAT. I KNOW HOW
HARKEN'S THOUGHTS RUN.

626
00:32:57,627 --> 00:33:01,196
A WAY TO BLAME YOU
WILL BE FOUND. DO YOU HEAR ME?YES.

627
00:33:01,196 --> 00:33:02,981
EXCELLENT.

628
00:33:02,981 --> 00:33:04,025
[door opens]

629
00:33:07,898 --> 00:33:10,510
GO.

630
00:33:10,510 --> 00:33:12,164
[clears throat]

631
00:33:12,164 --> 00:33:13,469
[door opens]

632
00:33:13,469 --> 00:33:15,428
DID LILITH NASH
COME BACK IN HERE?

633
00:33:15,428 --> 00:33:16,995
NO.

634
00:33:16,995 --> 00:33:18,648
UH, THAT'S ODD.

635
00:33:18,648 --> 00:33:20,650
WHERE'S LILITH NASH?

636
00:33:20,650 --> 00:33:22,043
UH, SHE LEFT WITH--

637
00:33:22,043 --> 00:33:23,827
YOU DON'T NEED TO WORRY
ABOUT HER.

638
00:33:23,827 --> 00:33:25,699
SHE'S NOT GUILTY.

639
00:33:25,699 --> 00:33:28,789
AND HOW DO YOU KNOW THAT?BECAUSE I ASKED HER.
SHE TOLD ME.

640
00:33:28,789 --> 00:33:32,227
UH-HUH. AND WHERE IS SHE NOW?UM... I DON'T KNOW.

641
00:33:32,227 --> 00:33:33,533
SECURITY.

642
00:33:33,533 --> 00:33:35,361
[blinds rattle]

643
00:33:35,361 --> 00:33:38,233
[siren wailing]

644
00:33:44,935 --> 00:33:47,851
SHE'S NOT IN HER ROOM.
SHE'S NOWHERE TO BE FOUND.

645
00:33:47,851 --> 00:33:50,289
OH, YOU PEOPLE ARE OVERREACTING.
I'M SURE SHE'S NO DANGER.

646
00:33:50,289 --> 00:33:53,161
SHE'S MENTALLY UNSTABLE
AND PROBABLY A KILLER,

647
00:33:53,161 --> 00:33:56,338
BUT YOU'RE SURE SHE'S NO DANGER.
WELL, THAT'S REASSURING.WELL, EVEN IF SHE IS
THOSE THINGS,

648
00:33:56,338 --> 00:33:58,688
AND I DON'T SAY THAT SHE IS,

649
00:33:58,688 --> 00:34:01,648
THEN SHE'S DONE HER WORST
ALREADY.MR. HARKEN!
WE HAVE A CODE RED.

650
00:34:01,648 --> 00:34:04,433
WHAT'S A CODE RED?WHAT? NO.

651
00:34:11,788 --> 00:34:13,051
OH, NO.

652
00:34:14,791 --> 00:34:16,750
OH.

653
00:34:22,147 --> 00:34:24,540
ANYONE WITHIN A QUARTER-MILE
RADIUS OF THIS FLASK

654
00:34:24,540 --> 00:34:27,021
IS GONNA BE DEAD WITHIN
THE NEXT FOUR TO SIX HOURS.

655
00:34:27,021 --> 00:34:29,328
BUT I PUT THE FLASKS
IN THE SAFE.

656
00:34:29,328 --> 00:34:33,245
SHE MUST HAVE GOTTEN
INTO THE SAFE SOMEHOW.W-- H-HOW IS THAT POSSIBLE?

657
00:34:33,245 --> 00:34:36,117
[indistinct conversations]

658
00:34:50,610 --> 00:34:51,611
[click]

659
00:34:55,397 --> 00:34:57,356
WHAT WAS THAT?

660
00:34:57,356 --> 00:34:59,097
A BEAKER FELL.WHAT?

661
00:34:59,097 --> 00:35:03,057
THERE'S ONLY ONE MISSING.

662
00:35:03,057 --> 00:35:06,147
THAT'S A RELIEF, ANYHOW.
BUT HOW DID SHE DO IT?

663
00:35:06,147 --> 00:35:09,150
NEVER MIND HOW. SHE'S DONE IT.
WHAT DO WE DO NOW?

664
00:35:09,150 --> 00:35:11,152
WELL, THERE'S NOTHING
WE CANDO.

665
00:35:11,152 --> 00:35:13,981
IN THE NEXT FOUR HOURS,
WE'LL ALL BE DEAD.[latches click]

666
00:35:13,981 --> 00:35:15,939
[lowers voice]
TELL ME THE TRUTH.

667
00:35:15,939 --> 00:35:17,376
THIS IS A TRICK RIGHT?

668
00:35:17,376 --> 00:35:20,074
NO. WHY WOULD I DO
SOMETHING LIKE THAT?

669
00:35:20,074 --> 00:35:23,295
WHAT WOULD BE THE POINT?SWEAR ON YOUR CHILD'S GRAVE.

670
00:35:23,295 --> 00:35:26,124
YOU KNOW I DON'T DO THAT,
NOT FOR ANYTHING.

671
00:35:30,215 --> 00:35:33,218
OH, MY GOD.

672
00:35:33,218 --> 00:35:35,437
THIS IS A DRILL, RIGHT?UH, THIS IS NOT A DRILL.

673
00:35:35,437 --> 00:35:38,005
THIS IS--THIS IS THE REAL THING.
I'M SORRY.

674
00:35:38,005 --> 00:35:40,660
[all murmuring]

675
00:35:40,660 --> 00:35:43,663
LISTEN UP.

676
00:35:43,663 --> 00:35:46,361
WE HAVE A FEW HOURS LEFT.

677
00:35:46,361 --> 00:35:49,059
BUT WE'LL KEEP
THIS VIRUS CONTAINED HERE.

678
00:35:49,059 --> 00:35:52,106
NOBODY LEAVES THIS FACILITY.

679
00:35:52,106 --> 00:35:56,066
AND THEN WHAT?
WE GET BURIED IN THE DESERT?

680
00:35:56,066 --> 00:35:58,373
THE AIR FORCE WILL DROP
INCENDIARY BOMBS

681
00:35:58,373 --> 00:36:01,115
ON THE FACILITY,
BURN THE VIRUS OUT.

682
00:36:01,115 --> 00:36:03,378
YOUR NEXT OF KIN
WILL BE INFORMED.

683
00:36:03,378 --> 00:36:07,077
LIKE I SAY,
WE HAVE A FEW HOURS LEFT,

684
00:36:07,077 --> 00:36:09,645
SO WE ALL SHOULD MAKE
OUR ARRANGEMENTS

685
00:36:09,645 --> 00:36:12,344
AND SAY OUR PRAYERS
AS BEST WE CAN.

686
00:36:12,344 --> 00:36:14,433
MAKE YOUR PHONE CALLS.

687
00:36:15,912 --> 00:36:18,263
MAY GOD HAVE MERCY
ON OUR SOULS.

688
00:36:18,263 --> 00:36:23,006
[indistinct conversations]

689
00:36:23,006 --> 00:36:24,225
[speaking inaudibly]

690
00:36:29,012 --> 00:36:32,538
[cell phone rings]

691
00:36:32,538 --> 00:36:35,497
HEY, BOSS. WE'RE ABOUT
FIVE MINUTES FROM YOUR LOCATION.

692
00:36:35,497 --> 00:36:37,064
Cho, listen.

693
00:36:37,064 --> 00:36:39,893
JANE AND I HAVE BEEN EXPOSED
TO THE VIRUS,

694
00:36:39,893 --> 00:36:43,113
AND IT LOOKS LIKE
WE MIGHT DIE SOON.

695
00:36:43,113 --> 00:36:45,855
OKAY.

696
00:36:45,855 --> 00:36:50,120
SO I WANNA THANK YOU AND RIGSBY
AND VAN PELT.

697
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:54,255
It's been an honor
working with you.

698
00:36:54,255 --> 00:36:56,605
I NEED YOU TO CALL
MY BROTHER TOMMY.

699
00:36:56,605 --> 00:36:58,607
HIS NUMBER IS
IN MY DESK DIARY.

700
00:36:58,607 --> 00:37:02,916
IT'S UNDER
TOWN AND COUNTRY ELECTRICAL.

701
00:37:02,916 --> 00:37:04,918
TELL HIM THAT I LOVE HIM

702
00:37:04,918 --> 00:37:07,877
AND THAT I FORGIVE HIM
FOR WHATEVER

703
00:37:07,877 --> 00:37:13,231
AND THAT, UM, HE NEEDS TO MAKE
PEACE WITH HIS BROTHERS.

704
00:37:13,231 --> 00:37:15,581
It's my last dying wish.
You tell him that.

705
00:37:15,581 --> 00:37:17,147
WILL DO.

706
00:37:17,147 --> 00:37:21,195
OKAY. GOOD-BYE.

707
00:37:21,195 --> 00:37:25,330
UH, WAIT. I-I WANTED
TO TALK TO THEM ALSO.

708
00:37:25,330 --> 00:37:26,635
SORRY.

709
00:37:26,635 --> 00:37:28,158
IT'S ALL RIGHT.

710
00:37:33,120 --> 00:37:34,817
THAT'S A FINE FAREWELL.

711
00:37:38,386 --> 00:37:42,216
I FEARED THAT YOU'D BECOME
TEARFUL AND INCOHERENT, BUT NO.

712
00:37:42,216 --> 00:37:44,784
SUCCINCT.

713
00:37:44,784 --> 00:37:47,134
NOBLE. BRAVO.

714
00:37:47,134 --> 00:37:49,049
UH-HUH.

715
00:37:51,530 --> 00:37:53,923
DON'T YOU HAVE ANYBODY
YOU WANNA CALL

716
00:37:53,923 --> 00:37:55,882
BESIDES CHO AND RIGSBY?

717
00:37:55,882 --> 00:37:57,275
NO.

718
00:37:59,581 --> 00:38:01,801
AND IF I WEREDYING,
I'D WANNA CALL YOU,

719
00:38:01,801 --> 00:38:04,630
BUT... YOU'RE ALREADY HERE.
SO THERE'S NO NEED.

720
00:38:04,630 --> 00:38:05,631
ME?

721
00:38:05,631 --> 00:38:07,067
HMM?

722
00:38:07,067 --> 00:38:08,503
WHAT WOULD YOU SAY?

723
00:38:08,503 --> 00:38:11,811
OH...

724
00:38:11,811 --> 00:38:16,555
UH... WAIT--
WAIT A MINUTE. IF?

725
00:38:18,861 --> 00:38:21,864
IFI WAS DYING?YEAH, YOU'RE NOT REALLY DYING.

726
00:38:21,864 --> 00:38:25,085
I WROTE A LABEL
AND PUT IT ON AN EMPTY FLASK,

727
00:38:25,085 --> 00:38:27,174
AND THEN I CONVINCED
POOR LILITH NASH TO RUN AWAY.

728
00:38:27,174 --> 00:38:30,308
I FEEL KIND OF BAD ABOUT IT--YOU SON OF A BITCH.

729
00:38:30,308 --> 00:38:33,006
BUT JUST--JUST WAIT.
JUST PLEASE. BE STILL. CHO?

730
00:38:33,006 --> 00:38:35,400
THIS IS JANE. PLEASE DISREGARD
LISBON'S LAST MESSAGE.

731
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:37,967
I TRICKED HER. MY BAD.
[whispers] I'M SO SORRY.

732
00:38:37,967 --> 00:38:41,101
[normal voice] ARE YOU AT
THE CULVERT? OKAY, GOOD. WAIT.

733
00:38:41,101 --> 00:38:43,843
THERE'LL BE SOME PEOPLE
COMING YOUR WAY SOON. BYE.

734
00:38:43,843 --> 00:38:45,584
YOU'RE SICK.

735
00:38:45,584 --> 00:38:48,238
WHY WOULD YOU DO THIS
TO ME?

736
00:38:48,238 --> 00:38:51,241
TWO REASONS--FIRSTLY, TO CATCH
THE KILLER OF ALICIA SEBERG,

737
00:38:51,241 --> 00:38:53,505
THE KILLER WHO IS NOT
POOR LILITH NASH.

738
00:38:53,505 --> 00:38:55,724
THE KILLER WHO,
YOU MAY RECALL,

739
00:38:55,724 --> 00:38:58,510
TOOK A DOSE OF THE ANTIDOTE
IN ORDER TO SURVIVE

740
00:38:58,510 --> 00:39:00,512
EXPOSURE TO THE VIRUS. YES?YES...

741
00:39:00,512 --> 00:39:02,340
THE KILLER WHO BELIEVES
THAT HE OR SHE

742
00:39:02,340 --> 00:39:05,343
IS THE ONLY ONE
THAT ISN'T GOING TO DIE. YES?YES.

743
00:39:05,343 --> 00:39:08,128
SO THEY HAVE TO GET OUT OF HERE
BEFORE WEDIE,

744
00:39:08,128 --> 00:39:11,131
OR ELSE THEY'LL BE BURNT
TO A CRISP BY THE AIR FORCE.

745
00:39:11,131 --> 00:39:14,134
THEIR HANDS ARE TIED.
THEY HAVE TO TRY TO ESCAPE,

746
00:39:14,134 --> 00:39:16,789
THUS REVEALING THEMSELVES TO US
WITH PRECISION AND CLARITY

747
00:39:16,789 --> 00:39:20,401
OF A MATHEMATICAL EQUATION.AND REASON NUMBER TWO?

748
00:39:20,401 --> 00:39:22,403
THE SECOND
AND MOST IMPORTANT REASON

749
00:39:22,403 --> 00:39:26,581
IS DOESN'T IT FEEL GREAT
TO GET YOUR LIFE BACK?

750
00:39:26,581 --> 00:39:28,583
DON'T YOU FEEL GOOD
RIGHT NOW?

751
00:39:28,583 --> 00:39:30,803
DON'T YOU FEEL HAPPY
TO BE ALIVE?

752
00:39:30,803 --> 00:39:32,021
NO!

753
00:39:32,021 --> 00:39:34,154
OH, I KNOW YOU DO.
YOU KNOW YOU DO.

754
00:39:34,154 --> 00:39:37,331
IF REASON NUMBER ONE DOES NOT
PAN OUT VERY, VERY SOON,

755
00:39:37,331 --> 00:39:40,465
I THINK I'M GONNA PUNCH YOU
IN THE NOSE.

756
00:39:40,465 --> 00:39:42,162
FORBEARANCE, LISBON.

757
00:39:42,162 --> 00:39:44,773
ANY MOMENT NOW, HARKEN IS
GONNA COME AROUND THAT CORNER

758
00:39:44,773 --> 00:39:47,297
WITH AN ANXIOUS EXPRESSION
ON HIS FACE

759
00:39:47,297 --> 00:39:49,299
BECAUSE SOMEONE HAS RUN OFF.

760
00:39:49,299 --> 00:39:51,040
ANY MOMENT NOW.

761
00:39:51,040 --> 00:39:53,695
WAIT.

762
00:39:53,695 --> 00:39:57,046
ANY MOMENT.

763
00:39:57,046 --> 00:40:00,093
[sighs]

764
00:40:00,093 --> 00:40:01,268
NOTHING.

765
00:40:04,358 --> 00:40:06,012
IF YOU JUST GET--

766
00:40:06,012 --> 00:40:08,144
[whack]OW!

767
00:40:08,144 --> 00:40:11,147
OW!

768
00:40:11,147 --> 00:40:15,195
[Patrick] OW. WHOO!

769
00:40:15,195 --> 00:40:17,327
[high-pitched voice] THAT'S WHAT
I'M TALKING 'BOUT.

770
00:40:38,348 --> 00:40:40,133
HI.

771
00:40:46,052 --> 00:40:48,794
WELL, THIS WAS ALL A HOAX?

772
00:40:48,794 --> 00:40:52,493
WELL, "HOAX" IS A LITTLE STRONG.
UH, MORE OF A RUSE, A GAMBIT.

773
00:40:52,493 --> 00:40:55,148
THE IMPORTANT THING IS
WE CAUGHT THE KILLER.

774
00:40:55,148 --> 00:40:58,281
RIGHT? THAT'S WHAT'S IMPORTANT.THAT'S WHAT'S IMPORTANT.
GRIFFIN WELKS, HUH?

775
00:40:58,281 --> 00:41:01,023
NEVER WOULD HAVE CAUGHT HIM
YOUR WAY, AND MY WAY--

776
00:41:01,023 --> 00:41:03,112
CATHARTIC
ANDLIFE-AFFIRMING.

777
00:41:03,112 --> 00:41:07,203
YOU KNOW WHAT?
YOU'RE ON YOUR OWN.

778
00:41:07,203 --> 00:41:09,858
OKAY, THE IMPORTANT THING NOW
IS TO BE CAREFUL

779
00:41:09,858 --> 00:41:12,774
'CAUSE THIS IS
THE REAL THING. OKAY?

780
00:41:12,774 --> 00:41:15,211
ALL RIGHT, LET'S GET THAT BACK
IN THE DEEP FREEZE.

781
00:41:15,211 --> 00:41:17,562
SEE YOU AROUND, BIG DOG.

782
00:41:17,562 --> 00:41:19,520
[door opens]

783
00:41:25,091 --> 00:41:28,224
I WAS SIPHONING OFF SMALL
AMOUNTS OF THE VIRUS MATRIX

784
00:41:28,224 --> 00:41:30,183
AND SELLING IT
ON THE BLACK MARKET.

785
00:41:30,183 --> 00:41:31,619
$300,000 A GRAM.

786
00:41:31,619 --> 00:41:34,317
YEAH.

787
00:41:34,317 --> 00:41:36,102
YEAH, EXACTLY.

788
00:41:36,102 --> 00:41:39,192
I'M IN CHARGE OF KEEPING
INVENTORY, SO IT WAS EASY,

789
00:41:39,192 --> 00:41:41,542
UNTIL HARKEN ARRIVED
TO DO A SPOT CHECK,

790
00:41:41,542 --> 00:41:44,458
AND I HAD TO DO SOMETHING FAST,
SO I SPILLED A FLASK

791
00:41:44,458 --> 00:41:46,547
TO COVER UP
THE MISSING QUANTITY.

792
00:41:46,547 --> 00:41:49,115
KNOWING FULL WELL
ALICIA SEBERG WOULD BE EXPOSED.

793
00:41:51,073 --> 00:41:55,034
[sighs]
SOMEONE HAD TO BE RESPONSIBLE.

794
00:41:55,034 --> 00:41:57,645
I FIGURED
EVERYONE WOULD THINK

795
00:41:57,645 --> 00:41:59,604
THAT SHE'D OPENED THE FLASK
BY ACCIDENT

796
00:41:59,604 --> 00:42:01,867
AND COULDN'T ADMIT TO IT,

797
00:42:01,867 --> 00:42:04,870
'CAUSE SHE WAS LIKE THAT--
COULDN'T BE WRONG.

798
00:42:04,870 --> 00:42:09,048
I'M CURIOUS. THE MONEY
YOU MADE FROM YOUR THEFT--

799
00:42:09,048 --> 00:42:10,397
HOW'D YOU SPEND IT?

800
00:42:10,397 --> 00:42:12,225
I DIDN'T.

801
00:42:12,225 --> 00:42:14,662
I HAVE IT IN TREASURY BONDS
MOSTLY, SOME REAL ESTATE.

802
00:42:14,662 --> 00:42:16,664
MM-HMM,
THAT'S SMART INVESTING.

803
00:42:16,664 --> 00:42:18,536
YOU'LL BE THE RICHEST MAN
IN FOLSOM.

804
00:42:21,539 --> 00:42:24,150
[blinds rattle]

805
00:42:26,152 --> 00:42:29,111
[Patrick exhales deeply]

806
00:42:29,111 --> 00:42:30,896
WHEW. LONG DAY.

807
00:42:32,593 --> 00:42:34,160
OOH.

808
00:42:34,160 --> 00:42:36,902
IT'S CHILLY AROUND HERE.
YOU STILL ANGRY WITH ME?

809
00:42:36,902 --> 00:42:38,730
DUH.[elevator doors open]

810
00:42:38,730 --> 00:42:40,906
OH, CONFESS.
YOU DO FEEL BETTER.

811
00:42:40,906 --> 00:42:43,561
YOU FEEL MUCH MORE ALIVE.
I KNOW YOU DO.

812
00:42:43,561 --> 00:42:46,694
YOU KNOW WHAT
MADE ME FEEL BETTER?

813
00:42:46,694 --> 00:42:49,392
PUNCHING YOU IN THE NOSE.

814
00:42:49,392 --> 00:42:53,222
AH. GLAD TO BE OF SERVICE.

815
00:43:00,099 --> 00:43:03,058
STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

